# Benchmark: event dispatch
# Workload: one program sends 100 UDP datagrams to itself over loopback and
# counts the "on data" handler calls until all have arrived. Measures the event
# loop's dispatch path (poll, receive, run handler). Uses loopback port 47391.

open udp on port 47391 and call it receiver
open udp and call it sender
received is 0
total is 100
data is bytes from text "x"
count from 1 to total as n
    send data through sender
        to "127.0.0.1"
        on port 47391
.

on data from receiver
    received is received plus 1
    if received is total
        say "event dispatch received" received
        close udp receiver
        close udp sender
    .
.
